XHIBIT Model Court CDU - Python CGI

Only index.php (also /), xhibit_content.php and screenshot.php are dynamic aliases.
There are no physical PHP files. The HTML shell/AJAX flow, clock, JavaScript,
CSS, images, localError.html and nine XSLs use the verified Model Court baseline.
The superseded partial/refresh/status endpoints and older assets are removed.

Keep pd_localproxy alongside this checkout. See its migration/README.md for
packaging (including the Python-only cdu.tar), tests, prerequisites and rollback.
MODEL_COURT_PROVENANCE.json records source hashes, not fleet certification.
Use a reviewed external config based on config/cdu.ini.example, never credentials
in a release archive. No runtime upgrade or new production dependency is included.
Physical CDU/updater/SELinux checks remain deployment gates.
